139	     * returned in a canonical form regardless of the casing supplied by the caller.
140	     * Syntactic validity is enforced separately by the {@code @Email} constraint on the DTO.
141	     * {@code @Named} keeps this out of MapStruct's automatic method selection, so it only
142	     * runs where a mapping explicitly references it via {@code qualifiedByName}.
143	     */
144	    @Named("normalizeEmail")
